# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file is a leftover from the pre-monorepo layout and is NOT read by any
# process.
#
# Vite's root is apps/web, so the only frontend env file it loads is
# apps/web/.env. Variables set here are invisible to the front end. Cloudflare
# Pages reads its variables from project settings at build time, not from disk.
#
# The real template is apps/web/.env.example.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------